================================================================================
IMPORTANT: THIS LICENCE COVERS THE CODE ONLY, NOT THE DATA
================================================================================

The MIT licence above applies to the source code in this repository.

It does NOT apply to:

  1. The cached upstream data in data/raw/, which remains under the licence of
     each publisher (ODbL 1.0 for OpenStreetMap; CC-BY 3.0 AU for Transport for
     NSW; CC-BY 4.0 for Victoria DEECA, QLD Transport and Main Roads, the
     Australian Capital Territory, and the State of Tasmania). This includes data/raw/geocode-cache.json,
     whose coordinates are Nominatim/OpenStreetMap-derived and therefore ODbL.

  2. The dataset this software produces (data/cache/dataset.json and the
     exports derived from it). Because that dataset incorporates OpenStreetMap
     data into a new database, it is a Derivative Database under the Open
     Database Licence 1.0, and ODbL share-alike applies to it:

         https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

     If you publicly convey that database, or any Derivative Database of it,
     you must keep it under the ODbL and attribute the sources. Run
     `evmap export --format odbl --out <dir>/` to produce a compliant bundle.

  3. The vendored copy of Leaflet in web/vendor/, which is distributed under
     its own BSD-2-Clause licence, Copyright (c) 2010-2024 Volodymyr Agafonkin,
     Copyright (c) 2010-2011 CloudMade.

Required attribution when redistributing the data:

